# Reproducible builds: every text file checks out with LF on every OS, so the
# files copied into dist/<target>/ and the zips they produce are byte-identical
# on Windows, macOS, and Linux CI. Verified by comparing release/SHA256SUMS.txt
# against the CI artifact.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
